## Scaling This File

Keep CLAUDE.md focused (~200 lines is a good ceiling). When it grows past that:

- **`@path` imports** — pull in shared docs on load: `@docs/architecture.md`, `@~/.claude/my-conventions.md`.
- **`.claude/rules/*.md`** — put topic rules in their own files with `paths:` frontmatter so they
  load only when Claude touches matching files (e.g. testing rules only when a `**/*.test.ts` is open),
  keeping always-on context lean:

  ```markdown
  ---
  paths: ["**/*.test.ts", "**/*.spec.ts"]
  ---
  Test conventions that apply only when working on test files.
  ```

  See <https://code.claude.com/docs/en/memory>.

